OL,3,GNEWSAHealth minister defends hospital
OL,4,Adeal decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FBinet said he thought it would have
OL,7,Fbeen "mindless" to let the process go
OL,8,Fon after the election and said new
OL,9,Fpoliticians might have wanted to "turn
OL,10,Fthe whole thing on its head".
